The complete, consolidated app.py and static/index.html below integrate per-display UID/GID isolation (10000 + disp_num), xauth cookie enforcement (Xvfb -auth replacing -ac), stale mss handle eviction, ticket-authenticated SSE, detached-tab pointer routing, and the /api/tabs/{tab_id}/touch revival endpoint.
Note: Ensure xauth is installed in your Dockerfile (apt-get install -y ... xauth) and docker-compose.yml includes cap_drop: [ALL] with cap_add: [SETUID, SETGID, CHOWN, DAC_OVERRIDE, KILL].
